      "explanation": "The appendix gives a general fixed-participation privacy-profile limit and calibrated offset. The exposition compares it with the fixed-rate result cited from Räisä, Jälkö, and Honkela (2024), while explicitly explaining that fixed q>0 does not specialize to q=E/T without uniformity in q. The source-correspondence assessment describes schedule adapters; this is not an asserted direct identity between differently parameterized statements.",
